## Context

Reading-3 (tracker [[0605]]). The Exp 2 query-mode axis is labelled
"naive" vs "optimised" (~49 occurrences in `main.tex`). The author: these
words "do not fit" — rename to describe what the arms actually are.

- "naive" → **single-shot** (arms 1 and 3)
- "optimised" → **multi-turn** (arms 2 and 4), driven with a simple harness

This is already the convention in the figure code
